{"last_link_id": 2, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. resolution = 1k\n释义：生成分辨率档位，1k 代表短边 1024 像素级输出\n对应尺寸换算（当前比例 3:4）：\n竖版 3:4：宽 768px，高 1365px\n作用：控制画面清晰度、显存占用，1k 兼顾速度与细节；2k 细节更高但爆显存风险提升\n2. aspectRatio = 3:4\n释义：画面宽高比 宽：高 = 3:4（标准人像竖版）\n3. skip_error = false\n释义：错误跳过开关，false = 关闭跳过、报错直接终止生成；true = 忽略报错强制出图\n4. seed = 1105858675\n释义：随机种子值，固定数字 = 锁定画面基础构图、人物五官基底\n. control_after_generate = randomize\n释义：生成完成后种子控制策略，三档可选：\nrandomize：每次生成完毕自动刷新随机新 seed；\nfixed：全程锁定当前 seed 不变；\nincrement：每次生成 seed 数字 + 1，微小改动画面。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [571.6166381835938, 544.7635498046875], "pos": [1854.4144287109375, 209.56942749023438], "id": 3, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [605.3534545898438, 1118.4847412109375], "pos": [1196.4320068359375, 240.13113403320312], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 1, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [1], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["鱼", "4:3", false, 1519126544, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget